#: yaffo/templates/utilities/sync_service.html:151
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(service)s needs to know which app is asking: register Yaffo with it "
"once, and every sync using this service reuses it. Kept in your system's "
"keychain, never in Yaffo's database, never sent to the AI model. Saving "
"new ones signs every sync using this service out."
msgstr ""
"تحتاج خدمة %(service)s إلى معرفة التطبيق الذي يرسل الطلب: سجّل Yaffo "
